{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"陈特征"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“陈特征”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>陈特征是一种"},{"Local":{"url":"示性类","text":"示性类"}},{"Plain":", 它定义了环同态 $K(X)\\to \\prod_k H^k(X;\\mathbb Q)$. 它将丛的直和对应到上同调的和, 将丛的张量积对应到上同调的积.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对向量丛 $E\\to X$, 任取其上的联络, 记 $R^E$ 为其"},{"Local":{"url":"曲率形式","text":"曲率形式"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}(E) = \\big[ \\operatorname{tr} \\exp \\big(\\frac{i}{2\\pi}R^E\\big)\\big]\\in H^{\\text{even}}(X,\\mathbb{R}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对于线丛 $\\xi$, $\\operatorname{ch}(\\xi)=e^{c_1(\\xi)}$, 其中 $c_1$ 为第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于秩为 $r$ 的局部自由层 $E$, 若</p>\n<h3>概形</h3>\n<p>对于光滑拟射影概形 $X$, 考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":" 的有界复形 Grothendieck 群 $K_0(X)$, 陈特征是 $K_0(X)$ 到"},{"Local":{"url":"周环","text":"周环"}},{"Plain":"的函子性的同态\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}\\colon K_0(X)\\to A(X,\\mathbb Q).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Todd 类</h2>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Chern+character\" title=\"nLab [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Chern+character]\">nLab</a></span></p>\n<p>设 $V\\to X$ 是紧拓扑空间上的复向量丛. "},{"Local":{"url":"Todd类","text":"Todd 类"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Td}(V)\\in H^{\\text{ev}}(X,\\mathbb Q)$</p>\n"}]}}